# Launcher split L8 (docs/engine/modularization_plan.md Part C): Multiplayer (presence, friends list, party, invites, dialogs, page) out of launcher/main.cpp -> launcher/Multiplayer.hpp/.cpp.
# `static` dropped on what the moved code shares (declared in LauncherShared.hpp / Multiplayer.hpp); every other added line is a declaration of that.
